  "explanation": "The attacker from IP address 203.0.113.42 attempted to gain unauthorized access to the production server by systematically guessing credentials for the 'admin' account via SSH. The consecutive failed password logs over a very short time window clearly indicate an automated brute-force attack.",
  "mitre_tactic": "Credential Access",
